  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CSF03-20 Year 2 Payment Integral Protection of Human Rights Defenders Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Integral protection of human rights defenders in Africa project aims to strengthen the protection and recognition of human rights defenders in sub-Saharan Africa, notably through engagement with international and regional human rights mechanisms, and increased legislative protection at the national level. Project activities will include training and advocacy as well as the provision of support and expertise.</narrative>
